OL,3,GNEWSANHS trust issue plea as critical  
OL,4,Aincident continues                     
OL,6,FAn NHS trust has urged people to stay  
OL,7,Fat home if they are unwell after       
OL,8,Fdeclaring a critical incident.         
OL,10,FDeclaring the incident on Monday,      
OL,11,FNottingham University Hospitals (NUH)  
OL,12,FNHS Trust said the "sharp increase" in 
OL,13,Fflu and Covid-19 cases had led to      
OL,14,F"pressure on staff and long waits for  
OL,15,Fpatients".                             
OL,17,FOn Tuesday, the trust said staff had   
OL,18,Fbeen working overnight to move patients
OL,19,Fout of hospital, but added 190 patients
OL,20,Fwere still waiting in the emergency    
OL,21,Fdepartment at the Queen's Medical      
OL,22,FCentre (QMC).                          
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
