OL,3,GNEWSANHS trust issue plea as critical  
OL,4,Aincident continues                     
OL,6,FIt advised people to collect their     
OL,7,Frelatives promptly if they get         
OL,8,Fdischarged from hospital, and to only  
OL,9,Fcall 999 or attend the emergency       
OL,10,Fdepartment if they are in a serious or 
OL,11,Flife-threatening condition.            
